        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அகழ்வாராய்ச்சி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அகழ்வாராய்ச்சி — akaḻvārāycci — \"an excavation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அகழ்வாராய்ச்சியில் பழைய நாணயங்கள் கிடைத்தன. akaḻvārāycciyil paḻaiya nāṇayaṅkaḷ kiṭaittaṉa. Old coins were found in the excavation."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A dig made to learn about the past; அகழ், to dig, is in it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அகழ்வாராய்ச்சி (akaḻvārāycci) is a Tamil compound built from அகழ்வு, \"digging\", from அகழ் (DEDR 11), and ஆராய்ச்சி, \"research\" (DEDR 377)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
